units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary f f f
#/atom 1 carbon
#/bond 1 1 1.85
lattice diamond 3.567
region simulation block -8 19 -8 19 -8 19 units box
create_box 1 simulation
region crystal block 0 2.999999 0 2.999999 0 2.999999 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region crystal
mass 1 12.011
pair_style airebo 3.0
pair_coeff * * CH.airebo C
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 0.00025
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step atoms temp pe ke etotal
min_style cg
minimize 1.0e-8 1.0e-6 1000 10000
velocity all create 100.0 49183 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix integrate all nve
fix thermal all langevin 100.0 100.0 0.1 82347 zero yes
run 0
